title: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Patient, insurance and request rows
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (Intake, the rows)
intro: Each row says where its value came from, and its button opens a small editor under the row. Edits go straight into the draft; nothing needs saving. A referral, a chart pulled from EMR Connect, a file Reader read, or a patient who is known fills them in, and every one stays editable. The rows are the same for an initial authorization and, without the request type and start date, for a retroactive one.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On Intake, read the Patient, Insurance and Request rows"
screen sc "Patient: 'Patient initials and age'\nInsurance: 'Payer and plan', 'Member ID' (Recommended)\nRequest: 'Level of care', 'Request type', 'Start date' (Recommended)\nEach row: a box, a label, a detail line and one button"

group gState "What a row can say"
  decision dSrc "Does the row have a value?"
  process r1 "Read from a file\n'Read from referral.pdf by Reader. Check it.'"
  process r3 "From a referral\n'From referral RF-2051'\nWith 'Referred by Eastgate Probation Services' under Patient"
  process r4 "From EMR Connect\n'From EMR Connect'"
  process r2 "Typed by a person\nThe detail shows the value with no source note"
  process r5 "Missing\n'Initials and age only. A name never enters the app.'\nRow shaded, button 'Add'"
  process r6 "Half filled\n'Found initials J.M. The age is still needed.'"
  process r7 "Left blank by a chart pull\n'Left blank. “Level of care” in the outpatient record needs a mapping. Map it, then pull the chart again.'\nLink 'Open EMR Connect'"
  process rNote "A source note goes quiet as soon as the value is edited"
endgroup

click cEdit "Click 'Add' (empty row) or 'Edit' (filled row)"
overlay oEd "Editor opens under the row\nThe first box takes focus\nOnly one editor is open at a time"
click cAgain "Click the same row button again"
process pClose "Editor closes"

group gRows "The editors"
  input iInit "Patient: 'Patient initials' (up to 8, shown in capitals, e.g. J.M.) and 'Age' (1 to 110)\n'Initials and age only. A name never enters the app.'"
  input iPayer "Payer and plan: pick 'Payer'\n'Plan type' fills in for that payer, and can be changed"
  input iMember "Member ID: type it\n'Agents see …4821 only. The full ID is removed before any agent reads the chart.'"
  input iLevel "Level of care: pick Residential 3.5, IOP, PHP or Detox\nThe editor closes at once"
  input iType "Request type (initial authorization only): Initial request or Admission\nAdmission adds 'notice due in about 5 hours'"
  input iStart "Start date: 'Requested start date' and 'Requested end date' (optional)\nThe row shows both, with today marked"
endgroup

click cDone "Click 'Done', or press Escape in a text box"
store stLive "Every keystroke is written to the draft\nNothing to save"
decision dRan "Had the agents already run?"
toast tStale "'Records changed after the agents ran'\n'Their work was cleared. The agents check again when you continue.'"
process pVerify "A changed payer, level of care, member ID or date makes the check on Eligibility & Benefits old or for another payer\nStep 2 shows it, and Verify runs again"
process pDocs "The payer and the level of care decide the document list on Clinical documentation"
goto gDup "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Possible duplicate"
goto gElig "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"
goto gDoc "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue"

s1 --> sc --> dSrc
dSrc -->|Read by Reader| r1
dSrc -->|From a referral| r3
dSrc -->|From the EMR| r4
dSrc -->|Typed| r2
dSrc -->|No| r5
dSrc -->|Only one of two| r6
dSrc -->|Blank because EMR Connect has no mapping yet| r7
r1 --> rNote
r3 --> rNote
r4 --> rNote
sc --> cEdit --> oEd
oEd --> iInit & iPayer & iMember & iLevel & iType & iStart
oEd --> cAgain --> pClose
r5 --> cEdit
r6 --> cEdit
r7 --> cEdit
iInit --> cDone
iPayer --> cDone
iMember --> cDone
iStart --> cDone
iLevel --> stLive
iType --> stLive
cDone --> stLive --> dRan
dRan -->|Yes| tStale --> pVerify
dRan -->|No| pVerify
pVerify --> gElig
pVerify -.-> pDocs --> gDoc
stLive -.-> gDup
